files: turnstile.glb (model/gltf-binary)
each file lands in your folder under its name, and its `fetched:` line names its /cdn/ address, the one the world uses. With no `fetched:` line below, `spawn tripo status 9c4e3813-9907-42a8-bc5a-50769bf13c89 --out turnstile.glb` lands them.
facing: a workshop file, so it faces the way its bytes do: Tripo puts the side that your --image picture shows on +X. Set model.forward to where the subject faces there: toward you "+x", away "-x", to the picture's left "+z", to its right no forward.
