origin: the engine stands this model with its lowest point on the object's feetPosition. Its lowest point is 0.600 m under the file's origin at the file's own size, so the origin draws 0.600 m straight above the feetPosition. model.offset: [0, -0.6, 0] makes the file's own origin the point the object turns about, for a hub.
